### ===========================================
### FRIENDSHIP - FULL DYNAMIC TEST FLOW (v2 - response handler scripts)
### Exécute les requêtes DANS L'ORDRE, de haut en bas, une par une.
### Les tokens et ids sont capturés automatiquement via client.global.set().
### ===========================================

### 0. Login User 10 (testuser01) -> saves token10
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser01",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token10", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 0. Login User 11 (testuser02) -> saves token11
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser02",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token11", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 0. Login User 12 (testuser03) -> saves token12
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser03",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token12", response.body.access_token);
%}

### 0. Login User 13 (testuser04) -> saves token13
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser04",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token13", response.body.access_token);
%}


### ===== HAPPY PATH: send -> accept =====

### 1. User10 sends a friend request to User11 -> saves requestId1011
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/request/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

> {%
    client.global.set("requestId1011", response.body.id);
%}

### 2. User10 tries to send again -> should be 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/request/11
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

### 3. User11 checks pending requests received
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token11}}

### 4. User11 accepts the request (uses the id saved at step 1)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/friendship/{{requestId1011}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token11}}

### 5. User10 checks friends list -> should include User11
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

### 6. User11 checks friends list -> should include User10
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token11}}


### ===== AUTO-ACCEPT PATH: mutual request =====

### 7. User10 sends a request to User12
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/request/12
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

### 8. User12 sends a request back to User10 -> auto-accepts instead of duplicating
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/request/10
Authorization: Bearer {{token12}}

### 9. Confirm User12 and User10 are now friends
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token12}}


### ===== REJECT PATH =====

### 10. User11 sends a request to User13 -> saves requestId1113
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/request/13
Authorization: Bearer {{token11}}

> {%
    client.global.set("requestId1113", response.body.id);
%}

### 11. User13 rejects it directly using the id saved at step 10
PATCH http://localhost:3000/friendship/{{requestId1113}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token13}}

### 12. Confirm it's gone from User13's pending list
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token13}}


### ===== BLOCK / UNBLOCK PATH =====

### 13. User10 blocks User13 -> saves blockId1013
POST http://localhost:3000/friendship/block/13
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

> {%
    client.global.set("blockId1013", response.body.id);
%}

### 14. User10 checks blocked list
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/blocked
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

### 15. User10 unblocks User13 using the id saved at step 13
DELETE http://localhost:3000/friendship/block/{{blockId1013}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}

### 16. Confirm blocked list is empty again
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/blocked
Authorization: Bearer {{token10}}


### ===== SECURITY CHECKS =====

### 17. User12 tries to accept a request that isn't theirs -> should 404
PATCH http://localhost:3000/friendship/{{requestId1011}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token12}}

### 18. No token -> should 401
GET http://localhost:3000/friendship/friends
